  "id": 1034,
  "description": "# ♣️ Black Bulls ♣️\n\n*&quot;Surpass your limits, right here, right now!&quot;*\n\nLed by **NC16**. We balance high-level progression with a supportive community.\n\n## ⚔️ Why Join Us?\n\n* **Weekly 9 hour Assaults**: currently at Skyreach Peak or Enchanted Oasis 19:00 (utc+0)\n* **Energizing Pools**: pools starting 10 to 15 minutes before all regular assaults on our schdule \n* **Internal Market**: guildies selling or offering services for good prices to other members\n* **Growth Focused**: Aiming for Max Level &amp; high-tier combat\n\n## 📜 Rules &amp; Requirements:\n\n* Preferably **CL80+** with decent gear for Assaults.\n* Mandatory **Discord**: https://discord.gg/qctcDDpKn8\n* Participation in Challenges, Stockpiles, assaults and raids if they get implemented is monitored.\n* **5-Day Inactivity Policy**: We check in before we kick!\n\n# \n### **Join the chaos, embrace the magic — become a magic Knight for the Black Bulls!**",
